  "id": "USN-8632-1",
  "summary": "node-follow-redirects vulnerability",
  "details": "Dennis Sepede discovered that follow-redirects did not properly remove\ncustom authentication headers when following cross-domain redirects. An\nattacker could possibly use this issue to obtain sensitive authentication\ninformation, resulting in credential disclosure.",
